      "category": "OFFICIAL",
      "date": "August 12, 2026",
      "title": "Randall Preserve Property Management Plan Formally Adopted by MRCA Governing Board",
      "summary": "The Mountains Recreation and Conservation Authority (MRCA) Governing Board has formally adopted the Randall Preserve Property Management Plan. This comprehensive plan outlines the future stewardship of the preserve, including the development of over five miles of trails that will offer scenic views of Catalina Island, Mt. Baldy, and the Palos Verdes Peninsula.",
      "source": "Coastal Corridor Alliance (Facebook) / L.A. Mountains (Facebook)",
      "sentiment": "POSITIVE"
    },
    {
      "id": "nmusd-parcel-debate-aug-2026",
      "category": "OFFICIAL",
      "date": "August 19, 2026",
      "title": "Debate Continues Over 11-Acre NMUSD Parcel Adjacent to Randall Preserve",
      "summary": "Negotiations are ongoing for an 11-acre parcel owned by the Newport-Mesa Unified School District (NMUSD) adjacent to the Randall Preserve, with competing proposals for its future. A developer is bidding to lease the land for nearly 200 housing units, while community advocates, including the Coastal Corridor Alliance, are pushing for its preservation as public open space, integrated with the nature preserve.",
      "source": "OC Register (via Coastal Corridor Alliance Facebook) / Hoodline / Los Angeles Times / Facebook",
      "sentiment": "MIXED"
    },
    {
      "id": "cca-september-beach-cleanup-announcement-aug-2026",
      "category": "LOCAL",
      "date": "August 13, 2026",
      "title": "Coastal Corridor Alliance Announces September Beach & River Mouth Cleanup",
      "summary": "The Coastal Corridor Alliance has announced a 'Special Beach Cleanup | Especial Limpieza de Playa' scheduled for Saturday, September 19, 2026. Volunteers are invited to participate at Newport Lifeguard Tower 74, located at the Santa Ana River Mouth, to help clean and restore the coastal corridor's habitats and protect local wildlife.",
      "source": "Eventbrite (Coastal Corridor Alliance)",
      "sentiment": "POSITIVE"
    }
